body=f'''<main id="main"><section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-top"><div class="eyebrow">Small team. Big possibilities.</div><a href="#contact" class="availability"><span class="status-dot"></span>15 agents available for work ↗</a></div><div class="hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><h1>Good people.<br>Great work.<br><em>No borders.</em></h1><p>Meet the remote team behind your next chapter. DVA Remotely Solutions connects growing businesses with people ready to make a difference.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="#contact">Find your next teammate <span class="arrow">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#services">Explore our work <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="hero-note">HUMAN CONNECTION. REMOTE POSSIBILITIES.</div></div>{globe}</div><div class="hero-bottom"><div class="industries"><span>Real estate</span><span>Surveys</span><span>Website services</span><span>Health insurance recruitment</span></div><a class="scroll-cue" href="#about">Discover DVA <span>↓</span></a></div></section><section class="wrap section" id="about"><div class="eyebrow reveal">01 / People are our starting point</div><div class="section-heading reveal"><h2>A small company.<br>A whole lot of potential.</h2><p>We’re a growing startup with a simple ambition: build meaningful partnerships through the people who make work happen.</p></div><div class="stats reveal"><article class="stat"><div class="stat-number" data-count="35">35<span>~</span></div><p>Agents in our team</p><small>A growing community of people</small></article><article class="stat"><div class="stat-number" data-count="15">15<span>↗</span></div><p>Available for work</p><small>Let’s talk about your needs</small></article><article class="stat"><div class="stat-number" data-count="4">4</div><p>Current clients</p><small>Across different industries</small></article><article class="stat"><div class="stat-number">∞</div><p>Possibilities ahead</p><small>Our next chapter starts with you</small></article></div><p class="stats-note">TEAM SNAPSHOT · Approximately 35 agents, 15 available, 4 current clients. Information supplied by Bernadette; availability subject to confirmation. “∞” represents our ambition.</p><section class="services" id="services"><div class="eyebrow reveal">02 / Where our people make an impact</div><div class="section-heading reveal"><h2>Different industries.<br>Same human touch.</h2><p>Our current clients span four sectors. Tell us where you’re headed, and we’ll explore how our team could fit.</p></div><div class="service-grid">{cards}</div><div class="service-foot"><span>Outsourced agents. Built around a conversation.</span><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Discuss your industry <span>↗</span></a></div></section></section><section class="wrap" id="partnership"><div class="partnership reveal"><div><div class="eyebrow">03 / Let’s grow together</div><h2>More than a project.<br>A partnership.</h2><p>We’re still a small startup. That means every new connection matters. We’re looking for businesses and partners who see the possibility in growing together.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Build something with us <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="steps"><div class="step"><span>01</span><div><h3>Start with a conversation.</h3><p>Tell Bernadette about your business, your goals, and the support you’re looking for.</p></div></div><div class="step"><span>02</span><div><h3>Explore the right fit.</h3><p>Discuss your requirements and our available people. Agree on the details together.</p></div></div><div class="step"><span>03</span><div><h3>Write the next chapter.</h3><p>Shape a working relationship with clear expectations and room to grow.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section wrap" id="contact"><div class="eyebrow reveal">04 / A good hello changes everything</div><div class="contact-grid"><div class="contact-intro reveal"><h2>Your next chapter?<br>Let’s talk.</h2><p>Looking for outsourced agents or a meaningful partnership? Connect directly with Bernadette on WhatsApp.</p><div class="contact-person"><div class="avatar">BM</div><div><strong>Bernadette Medina</strong><small>DVA Remotely Solutions · WhatsApp contact</small></div></div><a class="text-link" href="https://wa.me/639562991298" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">+63 956 299 1298 <span>↗</span></a><p class="small" style="margin-top:25px">This website is under construction. The form prepares a WhatsApp message for you to review and send.</p></div><form class="contact-form reveal" id="inquiry-form"><div class="form-row"><label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Alex Morgan" required maxlength="100"></label><label>Business name<input name="company" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Your company" required maxlength="120"></label></div><label>What brings you here?<select name="interest"><option>Outsourced agents</option><option>Partnership opportunities</option><option>Real estate support</option><option>Survey support</option><option>Website services support</option><option>Health insurance recruitment</option><option>Something else</option></select></label><label>A little about what you need<textarea name="message" placeholder="Tell us about your next chapter…" required maxlength="1500"></textarea></label><button class="button primary" type="submit">Prepare WhatsApp message <span class="arrow">↗</span></button><p class="form-status" role="status">Nothing is sent automatically. Your details stay in this browser until you choose to open WhatsApp.</p><a id="whatsapp-ready" class="text-link" hidden target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Review &amp; send on WhatsApp ↗</a><noscript><p class="small">JavaScript is needed for this form. Please use the WhatsApp phone link to contact Bernadette.</p></noscript></form></div><div class="faq reveal"><details><summary>Is this the final DVA website?</summary><p>No. This is an under-construction proposal concept created by MattyJacks.com to demonstrate a possible website for DVA Remotely Solutions. The design and copy are subject to client review.</p></details><details><summary>What work can DVA support?</summary><p>Bernadette shared that DVA currently provides outsourced agents to four clients in real estate, surveys, website services, and health insurance recruitment. Discuss specific roles, scope, skills, and working arrangements with her directly.</p></details><details><summary>How many agents are available?</summary><p>Bernadette reported approximately 35 agents in the team, with 15 available for work. Please confirm current availability directly; this demo is not a live staffing feed.</p></details><details><summary>Can MattyJacks build a website for my business?</summary><p>Yes. This demo showcases a website concept by MattyJacks.com. Visit <a class="text-link" href="https://mattyjacks.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MattyJacks.com ↗</a> to discuss a website for your business.</p></details></div></section></main>'''
write('index.html',page('DVA Remotely Solutions — Good people. Great work. No borders.',body,'An under-construction website proposal for DVA Remotely Solutions. Discover our people, industries and partnership opportunities. Concept by MattyJacks.com.'))

subpages={
'proposal':('A little context.','About this proposal','''<p>This is a creative website proposal for DVA Remotely Solutions, built as a demo to promote MattyJacks.com. It is under construction and has not been presented here as an approved official company website.</p><h2>The facts behind the concept</h2><p>Bernadette Medina provided the company name, WhatsApp contact (+63 956 299 1298), an approximate team size of 35 agents, 15 available agents, and four current clients. The clients operate across real estate, surveys, website services, and health insurance recruitment.</p><p>DVA describes itself as a small startup looking to grow through meaningful partnerships. This concept turns that story into a visual introduction. No customer endorsements, service guarantees, rates, or performance results are claimed.</p><h2>Made by MattyJacks</h2><p>Have a business that needs its own corner of the internet? MattyJacks creates websites for any business. Explore the possibilities at <a class="text-link" href="https://mattyjacks.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MattyJacks.com ↗</a>.</p>'''),
'privacy':('Your details. Your choice.','Demo privacy information','''<p>This static proposal site has no contact database, account system, analytics scripts, or form submission server.</p><h2>The inquiry form</h2><p>The form builds a WhatsApp message in your browser. It does not submit the information to this website. You can review the message before following the WhatsApp link and deciding whether to send it.</p><h2>External websites</h2><p>If you follow a WhatsApp or MattyJacks link, you leave this demo. Those services process information under their own policies. The hosting provider may maintain ordinary request logs; this demo does not control that infrastructure.</p><h2>Local preferences</h2><p>The motion preference lasts for your current page visit. This demo does not save it in cookies or browser storage.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For DVA inquiries, contact Bernadette Medina on WhatsApp at +63 956 299 1298. For this proposed website design, visit MattyJacks.com.</p>'''),
'404':('A little off the map.','Page not found','<p>This part of the story hasn’t been built yet. The DVA website is under construction.</p>')}
for name,(heading,title,copy) in subpages.items(): write(f'{name}.html',page(f'{title} — DVA proposal',f'<main class="wrap subpage" id="main"><div class="eyebrow">Under construction · MattyJacks demo</div><h1>{heading}</h1>{copy}<a class="button primary" href="./index.html">Back to DVA <span>↗</span></a></main>',title+' for the DVA Remotely Solutions demo by MattyJacks.com.'))

scripts={
'navigation': '''window.DVA.initNavigation=()=>{const button=document.querySelector('.menu-toggle'),menu=document.querySelector('.nav-links');if(!button||!menu)return;const close=()=>{menu.classList.remove('open');button.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');button.setAttribute('aria-label','Open menu')};button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const open=menu.classList.toggle('open');button.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));button.setAttribute('aria-label',open?'Close menu':'Open menu')});menu.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(a=>a.addEventListener('click',close));document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape'){close();button.focus()}})};''',
'reveal': '''window.DVA.initReveal=()=>{if(!('IntersectionObserver'in window)||matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches)return;document.documentElement.classList.add('js-motion');const observer=new IntersectionObserver(entries=>entries.forEach(entry=>{if(entry.isIntersecting){entry.target.classList.add('in-view');observer.unobserve(entry.target)}}),{threshold:.08});document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el=>observer.observe(el))};''',
'counters': '''window.DVA.initCounters=()=>{if(!('IntersectionObserver'in window)||matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches)return;const observer=new IntersectionObserver(entries=>entries.forEach(entry=>{if(!entry.isIntersecting)return;const el=entry.target,end=Number(el.dataset.count),suffix=el.querySelector('span'),start=performance.now();const tick=now=>{el.textContent=String(Math.round(end*Math.min(1,(now-start)/1000)));if(suffix)el.append(suffix);if(now-start<1000)requestAnimationFrame(tick)};requestAnimationFrame(tick);observer.unobserve(el)}),{threshold:.7});document.querySelectorAll('[data-count]').forEach(el=>observer.observe(el))};''',
'contact': '''window.DVA.initContact=()=>{const form=document.querySelector('#inquiry-form');if(!form)return;const ready=document.querySelector('#whatsapp-ready'),status=form.querySelector('[role="status"]');form.addEventListener('submit',event=>{event.preventDefault();const data=new FormData(form);const message=`Hi Bernadette! I found the DVA Remotely Solutions proposal website.\\n\\nName: ${data.get('name').trim()}\\nBusiness: ${data.get('company').trim()}\\nInterest: ${data.get('interest')}\\n\\n${data.get('message').trim()}`;ready.href='https://wa.me/639562991298?text='+encodeURIComponent(message);ready.hidden=false;status.textContent='Your message is ready. Open WhatsApp below to review and send it to Bernadette.';ready.focus()});form.addEventListener('input',()=>{ready.hidden=true;ready.removeAttribute('href');status.textContent='Nothing is sent automatically. Prepare your updated message when ready.'})};''',
'motion': '''window.DVA.initMotion=()=>{const button=document.querySelector('.motion-toggle');if(!button)return;button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const paused=document.documentElement.classList.toggle('motion-paused');button.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(paused));button.textContent=paused?'Resume motion':'Pause motion'})};''',
'scroll': '''window.DVA.initScroll=()=>{const button=document.querySelector('.to-top');if(!button)return;const update=()=>button.classList.toggle('visible',scrollY>600);window.addEventListener('scroll',update,{passive:true});update();button.addEventListener('click',()=>window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches?'instant':'smooth'}))};''',
'year': '''window.DVA.initYear=()=>document.querySelectorAll('[data-year]').forEach(el=>el.textContent=String(new Date().getFullYear()));'''
}
for name,content in scripts.items():write(f'js/{name}.js',content)
write('js/main.js','''window.DVA={};
const dvaBase=new URL('.',document.currentScript.src);
(async()=>{for(const name of ['navigation','reveal','counters','contact','motion','scroll','year']){try{await new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const script=document.createElement('script');script.src=new URL(name+'.js',dvaBase).href;script.onload=resolve;script.onerror=reject;document.head.append(script)});const method='init'+name[0].toUpperCase()+name.slice(1);window.DVA[method]?.()}catch(error){console.warn('DVA enhancement unavailable:',name)}}})();''')
write('README.md','''# DVA Remotely Solutions — proposal demo

Open `index.html` directly, or serve this directory with `python -m http.server 8091`.
No build, dependencies, external fonts, icon CDNs, or remote image services are needed.

This under-construction concept promotes MattyJacks.com. The information supplied by Bernadette is not a live availability feed. The contact form creates a WhatsApp deep link; visitors review and send the message themselves. There is no backend or stored inquiry data.

Structure: four HTML pages; modular CSS; progressive-enhancement JavaScript; original SVG favicon and eight SVG icons. All graphics are authored locally. Layouts adapt to mobile, keyboard navigation is supported, and reduced motion is respected.

Deploy the directory as static files. Configure your host to use `404.html` for missing pages if supported. All URLs are relative so the site also works at `/dva1/`.
''')
